      "url": "https://x.com/BBPHOfficial/status/1951239776344088827",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/BBPHOfficial/status/1951239776344088827",
      "text": "Billboard Philippines Studios, powered by Monkey Shoulder, proudly presents the Pinoy Hip-Hop Mixtape 2025 — featuring #AlexBruce, #CostaCashman, #CKYG, #YBNeet, #RobledoTimido, #Nio, #Supafly, #Sica, and #Waiian, performing alongside hip-hop giants #Abra, #HevAbi, #AlJames, and #Loonie.\n\nAmong the new wave of artists is #CKYG, whose rising status in the scene was solidified when he broke into the Billboard Philippines Hot 100.\n\nIn this exclusive performance, CK YG delivers a steady yet sharp reflection on ambition, struggle, and staying grounded while reaching for more. His verses weave between memory and intention, capturing the fire behind today’s Filipino hip-hop.\n\nCatch the performances of the 13 artists, out now on Billboard Philippines’ YouTube channel. Subscribe today!\n\n#BillboardPH\n#BillboardPhilippines\n#BillboardPhilippinesStudios\n#PinoyHipHopMixtape",
